[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0810","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0810.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1114","title":"Unify eWave ServletExec 3 JSP 源代码泄露漏洞","description":"Unify eWave ServletExec 3.0C 存在 JSP 源代码泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送以特殊字符（如 \".\", \"+\", \"%20\" 等）结尾的恶意 HTTP 请求，绕过服务器对 JSP 文件的访问限制，导致服务器返回 JSP 源代码而非执行后的结果。该漏洞可导致攻击者获取 Web 应用后端逻辑、数据库连接凭证等敏感信息，严重威胁应用安全。无需认证即可利用，攻击门槛低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1114"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:10.633","remediation":"建议升级 ServletExec 至 v3.0E 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中得到修复。如无法立即升级，可在前端 Web 服务器（如 Apache、IIS）配置 URL 过滤规则，拦截以 `.`、`+`、`%20` 结尾的 JSP 请求，或使用 URL 重写模块规范化请求路径，防止源文件泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0285.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1970","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20412","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/47aadecb5d7f9b0723652503f764f5addc1275b9/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1114.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1114","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1114.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4dd512046a74ddd9ae16741caf0933056ffd666e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1114.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bbc8c0a71659f005292a66be54d5a75a1b892d59/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fcmp-4fvx-mvrf/GHSA-fcmp-4fvx-mvrf.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1114.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--43abadbf-d974-4f71-9fe8-21633cf51930.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/CWE-Expert/blob/f634e911e6c24a1ad8b9619383e2ab3eb2d9ebd4/CWE_corpus/markdown/4_cwe_trimmed_top25.md.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0810.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0805","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0805.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1113","title":"Microsoft Windows Media Player 7.0 ASX 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Media Player 7.0 处理 .ASX（Active Stream Redirector）文件时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可构造特制的 .ASX 文件诱导用户打开，触发缓冲区溢出，进而导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows Media Player 7.0 及可能更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。用户应避免打开来源不明的 .ASX 文件并更新至最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1113"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:10.483","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-090 提供的补丁：Windows Media Player 6.4 用户下载 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=9B94D3F0-9CF3-4A5F-8215-A221DDD923B0，Windows Media Player 7 用户下载 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=BAF62356-D717-4B8F-97E0-299A7697A083。也可通过 Windows Media Player 自动更新功能获取修复。对于仍在使用旧版系统的环境，建议升级操作系统或更换为支持最新安全更新的 Windows Media Player 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a112300-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1980","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-090","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5574","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20427","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/47aadecb5d7f9b0723652503f764f5addc1275b9/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1113.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1113","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1113.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4dd512046a74ddd9ae16741caf0933056ffd666e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1113.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f057ddadcfa5b728874a5ddd491736cdccd3b4c2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q842-grxw-g4xw/GHSA-q842-grxw-g4xw.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1113.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5b0deb9a-005c-478a-afac-a816f577f99b.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0805.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0801","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0801.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1110","title":"IBM Net.Data 7.0 完整路径泄露漏洞","description":"IBM Net.Data 7.0 的 db2www 组件中存在全路径泄露漏洞。document.d2w CGI 程序未对用户输入的指令参数进行有效过滤，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向该程序发送不存在的命令，从而触发服务器返回物理路径信息，导致 Web 服务器目录结构等敏感信息泄露。攻击者可利用泄露的路径信息进一步探测其他漏洞或实施针对性攻击。该漏洞影响 IBM Net.Data 7.0 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1110"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:10.103","remediation":"建议升级 IBM Net.Data 至 7.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复路径泄露问题。如无法升级，应修改 document.d2w 脚本，对无效命令不输出详细错误信息；同时在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache/IBM HTTP Server）配置自定义 404/500 错误页面，关闭详细错误提示路径，并可结合 chroot 机制限制 CGI 脚本可访问的文件系统范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0384.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2017","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20441","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3d8ee18720c8a74c03524a9994e81b2de7f6b0ec/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1110.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1110","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1110.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4dd512046a74ddd9ae16741caf0933056ffd666e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1110.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5113e9b43f598fb5a0e0333780445658279ab459/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mxff-qcf2-5cjv/GHSA-mxff-qcf2-5cjv.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1110.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2017/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/158dea8303c58859521e12d6c7ff455ac536c21d/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0801.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0801.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0798","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0798.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1105","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 Indexing Service ixsso.query ActiveX 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Microsoft Indexing Service 中的 ixsso.query ActiveX 控件被错误标记为\"对脚本安全\"，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页，利用该控件执行客户端脚本探测目标 Windows 2000 系统上任意文件是否存在，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响启用了 Indexing Services 的 Windows 2000 系统，攻击者无需身份认证，仅需用户使用 IE 浏览器访问恶意站点即可触发，危害程度中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1105"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:09.463","remediation":"Windows 2000 已停止支持，建议升级至 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2019+ 受支持版本。如无法升级，可通过注册表为 ixsso.query 控件设置 Kill Bit（CLSID: {C1B8BF2E-0AC3-11D1-8C71-00AA00BCC6B1}，Compatibility Flags 设为 0x400），禁用 Indexing Service（服务管理器 → Indexing Service → 启动类型设为禁用），并将 IE 安全区域中 ActiveX 控件和 Active Scripting 均设为禁用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q4/0074.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/144270","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1933","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20399","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-1105.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3d8ee18720c8a74c03524a9994e81b2de7f6b0ec/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1105.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1105","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1105.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1105.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/73ac284751e17fef1b5ac58de8febf3e5ceb6f4c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hrjf-28rx-wf7r/GHSA-hrjf-28rx-wf7r.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-1105.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1933/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3e4508d9-5c78-43e4-8cb8-735d68188731.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0798.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0798.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0798.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0797","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0797.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1103","title":"BSDi rcvtty 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"BSDi 3.0 和 4.0 系统自带的 rcvtty 工具在执行脚本前未能正确丢弃特权权限，存在本地权限提升漏洞。具有系统普通账户访问权限的本地攻击者可通过在命令行中指定恶意的特洛伊木马脚本，利用 rcvtty 的权限缺陷以更高权限执行任意代码，从而完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响 BSDi 3.0 及 4.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1103"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:09.207","remediation":"建议升级到 BSD/OS 4.1 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可临时移除 rcvtty 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/rcvtty），并严格限制本地用户的可信度，仅授予受信任用户 shell 访问权限以降低提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/147120","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2009","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/202","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-1103.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3d8ee18720c8a74c03524a9994e81b2de7f6b0ec/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1103.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1103","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1103.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1103.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d4e2196ceafb139802f6ffd1005691ff1a777bac/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x37q-rf4q-x5w3/GHSA-x37q-rf4q-x5w3.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2009/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-1103.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1103.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0797.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0795","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0795.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1100","title":"Trlinux Postaci Webmail 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"PostACI Webmail 系统 1.1.3 版本默认配置将 /includes/global.inc 配置文件放置在 Web 根目录下，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过直接发送 HTTP GET 请求访问该文件，从而泄露数据库用户名和密码等敏感信息。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，影响运行 Trlinux Postaci Webmail 1.1.3 的服务器。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1100"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:08.807","remediation":"立即将 /includes/global.inc 配置文件移出 Web 根目录（如移到上一级目录），并修改 Web 服务器配置（Apache 添加 <FilesMatch \"\\.inc$\"> Deny from all 规则）禁止直接访问 .inc 后缀文件。同时立即更改配置文件中已泄露的数据库用户名和密码。作为临时缓解措施，可在 Web 服务器或 WAF 层面添加规则，拒绝直接访问 /includes/ 路径下的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0433.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2029","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20450","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/72f387512fbbb3f0e46713b23cdbd1f9c533d1f7/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1100.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1100","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1100.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1100.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0e291808cb617ccf4c842a91d82530cb507f8570/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r56m-86mv-452f/GHSA-r56m-86mv-452f.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2029/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1100.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/kookaip/PhD-ICSE2023-PrivacyVulnerabilities/blob/f07e7ceba63e856fe3d9dd40cee793b0ef452153/replication-package/data/7-cve-coder2.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0795.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0793","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0793.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1096","title":"Paul Vixie vixie-cron 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"vixie-cron（Paul Vixie 开发的 cron 实现）在处理 crontab 编译时存在不安全的临时文件创建漏洞。由于 crontab 使用可预测的文件名创建临时文件，且未能正确校验文件所有权，拥有 crontab spool 目录写入权限的本地攻击者可通过创建全局可写的临时文件，在受害者使用 crontab -e 编辑时篡改文件内容，从而执行任意命令实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 vixie-cron 各版本，CVSS 评分 3.7，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1096"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:08.263","remediation":"升级 vixie-cron 至 3.0pl1-54 及以上版本，该修复改用 mkstemp() 创建临时文件并校验文件所有者身份。如系统使用 cronie，升级至 4.2 及以上版本。限制 /var/spool/cron 目录的写入权限，仅授权用户可写。作为临时缓解措施，监控 /tmp 目录下 crontab.* 临时文件的异常创建行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0237.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1960","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5543","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/203","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/72f387512fbbb3f0e46713b23cdbd1f9c533d1f7/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1096.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1096","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1096.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1096.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0e291808cb617ccf4c842a91d82530cb507f8570/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3h2g-8x7p-qmjq/GHSA-3h2g-8x7p-qmjq.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2000/20001118a.data","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1096.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c62a51c8-4449-487b-8f2a-c791c6a1ecec.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5116d66f715b098d7dc74f3fb3559215242e5dbf/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0793.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0792","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0792.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1095","title":"Linux modutils modprobe 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Linux modutils 2.3.x 包中的 modprobe 程序未对用户输入的参数进行充分过滤，本地攻击者可通过在传递给 modprobe 的参数中注入 shell 元字符（如反引号、$() 等）来执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响使用 modutils 2.3.x 版本的 Linux 系统，攻击者需要拥有本地访问权限，成功利用后可获取 root 权限，完全控制目标系统。目前已存在公开的利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1095"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:08.130","remediation":"升级 modutils 至 2.3.11 或更高版本，该版本修复了 modprobe 对 shell 元字符的过滤处理。对于 Debian 系统，通过 apt-get install --only-upgrade modutils 更新；对于 Red Hat/Mandrake 系，安装对应安全公告（MDKSA-2000-071）提供的更新包。如无法立即升级，可移除 modprobe 的 suid 权限（chmod -s /sbin/modprobe）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0179.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/suse/2000-q4/0596.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000340","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001120","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-071-1.php3?dis=7.1","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-108.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1936","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5516","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20402","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-1095.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1095.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1095","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1095.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1095.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7753-m7xj-hvxr/GHSA-7753-m7xj-hvxr.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2000/20001120.data","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2000-071.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1095.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0792.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0790","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0790.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1094","title":"AOL Instant Messenger BuddyIcon 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"AOL Instant Messenger（AIM）4.3.2229之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的\"buddyicon\"指令，其中包含超长\"src\"参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。攻击者只需诱使目标用户接收恶意消息即可完成利用，无需用户交互，危害性高。AOL已发布更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1094"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:08.013","remediation":"升级 AOL Instant Messenger 至 4.3.2229 或更高版本，该版本已修复 BuddyIcon 命令处理中 src 参数长度校验不足导致的缓冲区溢出问题。由于 AOL Instant Messenger 已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的即时通讯软件以持续获得安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97668265628917&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97683774417132&w=2","http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a121200-1.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/1692","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20511","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-1094.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1094.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1094","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1094.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1094.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5292a7ad2431699c03050ab1a8e2e3a6e103d9a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gj55-f7mm-vjjc/GHSA-gj55-f7mm-vjjc.json","https://github.com/RealVulnerabilityEdu/webvulmap/blob/fce45e360a43c8b76eee23ec2765df22272d83bb/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-1094.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-120.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--26d58156-373d-42e4-b880-52e730187841.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0790.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0787","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0787.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1093","title":"AOL Instant Messenger aim:// 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"AOL Instant Messenger（AIM）在处理 \"goim\" 命令时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的超长 \"goim\" 命令触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 AOL Instant Messenger 4.3.2229 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1093"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:07.890","remediation":"升级 AOL Instant Messenger 至 4.3.2229 或更高版本以修复该缓冲区溢出漏洞。临时缓解措施：在防火墙或网络层面拦截异常的 `aim://` 协议请求，并警惕来自不可信来源的超长即时消息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a121200-1.txt","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5732","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20510","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1093.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1093","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1093.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1093.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ab96f9177ee90a5f19d09110efe1f64b34e91053/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-37q9-236v-5578/GHSA-37q9-236v-5578.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3ab7e5ec3518928f79ddbe5f4002d6a70b5ae705/2000/CVE-2000-1093.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2118/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0787.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0787.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0787.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0786","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0786.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1092","title":"alex heiphetz Group EZshopper 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Alex Heiphetz Group EZshopper 2.0 及 3.0 版本的 loadpage.cgi CGI 程序存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过在 file 参数的目标文件名前插入 \"/\" 字符，即可突破路径限制，遍历并读取 EZshopper 数据目录中的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1092"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:07.783","remediation":"立即联系 AHG 获取 EZshopper 最新版本进行升级，新版本已对 file 参数增加 \"../\" 路径遍历检查。如无法升级，应删除或禁用 loadpage.cgi 脚本，或在 Web 服务器（如 Apache）层面通过 RewriteRule 或 Location 指令限制对该 CGI 的访问，仅允许白名单 IP 调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97676270729984&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2109","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5740","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20507","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1092.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1092","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1092.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1092.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5da0a5f6cef8a27d290daf0d2c65fed1d1f621b9/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5576-9r4v-7ffw/GHSA-5576-9r4v-7ffw.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1092.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d8d8aa7e-6946-4ced-b377-c8ab9d216e1b.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0786.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0785","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0785.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1089","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 电话簿服务缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 Phone Book 服务（电话簿服务）中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，当处理超长输入数据时未能正确验证缓冲区边界，导致可被用于覆盖内存中的关键数据结构。本地攻击者可通过向受影响的 Phone Book 服务发送特制的请求触发缓冲区溢出，从而以系统权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 系统，微软已发布 MS00-094 安全公告修复此问题，Metasploit 框架中已有公开利用模块。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1089"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:07.557","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-094 提供的补丁（KB276575）。Windows NT 4.0 需先安装 SP6a 后再应用该补丁；Windows 2000 需在 Gold 或 SP1 基础上安装。如非必要，通过「添加/删除程序」中的 Windows 组件向导卸载 Phone Book Service（即 Internet 连接服务中的电话簿服务）作为临时缓解措施。由于 Windows NT 4.0 已停止支持，建议升级到受支持的 Windows Server 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2048","http://www.stake.com/research/advisories/2000/a120400-1.txt","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-094","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5623","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20460","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-1089.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad6ba3d27513a57837704589c10c0be969a18efd/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1089.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1089","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1089.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/1772.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1089.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5da0a5f6cef8a27d290daf0d2c65fed1d1f621b9/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pj32-r99j-9hr4/GHSA-pj32-r99j-9hr4.json","https://github.com/swimlane/soc-faker/blob/361c4ae88956878fbd8aaf5975044328556dfecd/socfaker/data/alert_names.txt","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/0c1943928e18d8739c9776e9094da2df90ca5e87/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0785.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0783","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0783.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1085","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 扩展存储过程 xp_peekqueue 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0/2000 及 SQL Server Desktop Engine (MSDE) 中的 xp_peekqueue 扩展存储过程存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该函数调用 srv_paraminfo API 时未正确限制参数长度，允许攻击者通过向 SQL Server 发送特制的数据库查询请求触发缓冲区溢出，可导致服务崩溃或执行任意命令，即\"扩展存储过程参数解析\"漏洞。攻击者需要对目标数据库具备一定访问权限才能实施利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1085"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:07.090","remediation":"建议升级到 Microsoft SQL Server 2000 Service Pack 1 (SP1) 或更高版本，该补丁修复了 xp_peekqueue 函数中的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法立即升级，可通过执行 `EXEC sp_dropextendedproc 'xp_peekqueue'` 删除该扩展存储过程，或使用 `DENY EXECUTE ON xp_peekqueue TO PUBLIC` 回收公开执行权限以临时缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97570884410184&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2040","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-092","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20457","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-1085.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad6ba3d27513a57837704589c10c0be969a18efd/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1085.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1085","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1085.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1085.md","https://github.com/dependency-check/DependencyCheck/blob/7dcfc0737c21744b423c2198ae979003c2eb67e2/core/src/main/resources/dependencycheck-base-suppression.xml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d34115c5df8a79b3a76d7097ef910b9992c9ee85/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gjpv-7qjf-vj7x/GHSA-gjpv-7qjf-vj7x.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/1xxx/cve-2000-1085.yaml","https://github.com/chris-anley/papers/blob/49022789f281abb9549bf3d8df12a62acf6a6554/cve-ids.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0783.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0779","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0779.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1081","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0/2000 xp_displayparamstmt 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0/2000 及 Microsoft 数据引擎 (MSDE) 1.0/2000 中的 xp_displayparamstmt 扩展存储过程函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当调用 SQL Server 扩展存储过程 API 中的 srv_paraminfo 函数时，该函数未能正确限制缓冲区长度，导致攻击者可通过向受影响系统发送特制的参数触发缓冲区溢出，进而造成拒绝服务或执行任意命令。攻击者只需具备数据库访问权限即可利用此漏洞，无需高级权限。该漏洞又名\"扩展存储过程参数解析\"漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1081"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:06.653","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-092 对应补丁：SQL Server 7.0 用户升级至 Service Pack 3（含补丁），SQL Server 2000 用户升级至 Service Pack 1（含补丁），MSDE 1.0/2000 用户安装对应补丁包。建议将 SQL Server 服务账号配置为最低权限普通用户账号，避免使用管理员权限运行。检查所有第三方扩展存储过程（XP）对 srv_paraminfo() 的调用，确保调用前已分配足够大小的缓冲区。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97570878710037&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2030","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-092","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A231","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20451","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-1081.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4382b0b8593e7ef30616ab300314afbbf1571636/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1081.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1081","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1081.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1081.md","https://github.com/dependency-check/DependencyCheck/blob/7dcfc0737c21744b423c2198ae979003c2eb67e2/core/src/main/resources/dependencycheck-base-suppression.xml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29756569ae7c866e39492d6faf2dcdff310590f7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6pm9-q8g6-xp59/GHSA-6pm9-q8g6-xp59.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/1xxx/cve-2000-1081.yaml","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mssql_version.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0779.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0653","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0653.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0897","title":"Max Feoktistov Small HTTP Server 目录索引缺失拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Max Feoktistov Small HTTP Server 2.03 及更早版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过反复请求不包含 index.html 文件的目录 URL，导致服务器内存持续消耗且请求完成后不释放，最终耗尽内存资源导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Small HTTP Server 2.03 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响可用性。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起攻击，通过持续发送针对无索引文件目录的请求耗尽服务器内存资源，导致服务拒绝。该漏洞由 Max Feoktistov Small HTTP Server 处理目录索引文件逻辑缺陷导致内存泄漏引发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0897"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:42.860","remediation":"立即升级到 Small HTTP Server 最新版本（如 2.04 或更高版本），修复原有版本在处理缺失 index.html 文件时的内存释放漏洞。配置文件中添加 `MaxMemoryCache=0` 禁用内存缓存，或设置 `Timeout=30` 限制连接保持时间，防止长时间占用资源攻击。如果无法升级，可在反向代理层面启用 `URI` 路径验证，仅允许访问预定义的有效资源，拒绝特定模式的异常请求以实现临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://home.lanck.net/mf/srv/index.htm","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97421834001092&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1941","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5524","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20403","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0897.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0897","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0897.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0897.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/64db5db4a6681c330f93cc62718610a5bc70bd7a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gf7m-qm5r-6g63/GHSA-gf7m-qm5r-6g63.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/